# Local file storage backend (STORAGE_BACKEND=local).
#
# Anchored to the repository root. Unanchored, `storage/` matches a directory of that name at
# any depth — and it did: it silently excluded `apps/api/vendoriq_api/storage/`, the storage
# abstraction itself (ADR-002's local and s3 backends), from every commit since phase 0. The
# working tree had the files, so nothing local ever failed; the first CI run on a fresh clone
# could not import the application at all.
/var/
/storage/

